      "title": "Finance Faculty Position",
      "description": "Duke University, Fuqua School of Business (Faculty) Skip to main content AcademicJobsOnline .org ‌ View Jobs Events Registered Employers Contact Us Login Duke University, Fuqua School of Business (Faculty) Position ID: Duke-Fuqua School of Business (Faculty)-FINANCE [#32259] Position Title: Finance Faculty Position Position Type: Tenured/Tenure-track faculty Position Location: Durham, North Carolina 27708, United States of America [ map ] Subject Area: Finance Appl Deadline: 2026/11/15 23:59:59  (posted 2026/06/26 , listed until 2026/11/30) Position Description: Apply Position Description Duke University’s Fuqua School of Business invites applications for a tenure-track faculty position in Finance for the 2027-2028 academic year, subject to university approval. We will consider candidates across all ranks. We seek candidates with high research potential or achievement, and an interest in teaching in the School’s daytime MBA, other Master’s, and Ph.D. programs. Candidates should have a Ph.D. degree in Finance, Economics, or related discipline, and a strong research record. Duke University offers an excellent research environment and is consistently ranked among the world’s top universities. The Raleigh-Durham-Chapel Hill area provides an exceptional mix of a growing innovation hub, high quality of life, and extensive cultural and leisure opportunities. Applications must include a curriculum vitae, job market paper, and three letters of recommendation,  and should be submitted electronically at: https://academicjobsonline.org/ajo/jobs/32259 The application deadline is November 15, 2026. Duke University\r\n is an Equal Opportunity Employer committed to providing employment \r\nopportunity without regard to an individual's age, color, disability, \r\ngender, gender expression, gender identity, genetic information, \r\nnational origin, ethnicity, race, religion, sex (including pregnancy and pregnancy \r\nrelated conditions), sexual orientation, or m